{
  "cues": [
    {
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "This iron pillar is about sixteen hundred"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 2.4727,
      "end_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "years old."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 3.4182,
      "end_seconds": 5.3091,
      "text": "And something helped protect it:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 5.3818,
      "end_seconds": 6.1091,
      "text": "rust."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 6.4,
      "end_seconds": 8.2182,
      "text": "The pillar stands in Delhi, India."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 8.6545,
      "end_seconds": 10.7636,
      "text": "The part above ground has survived remarkably"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 10.8364,
      "end_seconds": 11.2727,
      "text": "well."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 11.4909,
      "end_seconds": 13.0182,
      "text": "But that doesn't mean the iron never"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 13.0909,
      "end_seconds": 13.7455,
      "text": "rusts."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 13.9636,
      "end_seconds": 16.0727,
      "text": "A dense layer of corrosion products formed"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 16.1091,
      "end_seconds": 16.9455,
      "text": "on its surface."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 17.1636,
      "end_seconds": 18.6182,
      "text": "It makes it harder for moisture to"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 18.6909,
      "end_seconds": 20.9091,
      "text": "reach the metal and slows further damage."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 21.1636,
      "end_seconds": 23.1273,
      "text": "Phosphorus in the iron helps this protective"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 23.2,
      "end_seconds": 24.0364,
      "text": "layer form."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 24.2909,
      "end_seconds": 25.9636,
      "text": "The surrounding conditions matter too."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 26.4,
      "end_seconds": 28.1455,
      "text": "The pillar isn't invincible:"
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 28.2909,
      "end_seconds": 30.4364,
      "text": "below ground, it has rusted more heavily."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 30.6909,
      "end_seconds": 33.5273,
      "text": "So rust doesn't always just destroy iron."
    },
    {
      "start_seconds": 33.7455,
      "end_seconds": 36.0,
      "text": "Sometimes, it helps protect the metal underneath."
    }
  ]
}
